<title>USA: CUNO sees new records in FY'96 results.</title>
<headline>CUNO sees new records in FY'96 results.</headline>
<dateline>MERIDEN, Conn. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>CUNO Inc said Thursday its fourth quarter results will be solid but that they will not match third quarter results because of a traditional slowdown in August associated with customer vacation schedules.</p>
<p>Nevertheless, the company said that excluding distribution costs, the fourth quarter should exceed the year-ago performance and that it expects its fiscal 1996 results to set new records for a 12-month period and surpass 1995 levels.</p>
</text>
